{"id": "wwdc2017-822", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2017/822", "wordCount": 1864, "segments": [{"start": 21.0, "text": "You all know that every app,"}, {"start": 23.0, "text": "even your app, needs an app"}, {"start": 24.0, "text": "icon."}, {"start": 25.0, "text": "It's the symbol that represents"}, {"start": 27.0, "text": "your product on the Home screen"}, {"start": 29.0, "text": "and the App Store."}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "Humanity has been using symbols"}, {"start": 32.0, "text": "to communicate ideas since"}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "antiquity; even Apple was doing"}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "this a long, long time ago."}, {"start": 39.0, "text": "I'm only joking."}, {"start": 40.0, "text": "I'm only joking, of course."}, {"start": 41.0, "text": "I hope there are no"}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "egyptologists  in the room that were offended."}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "But in all seriousness, we have"}, {"start": 45.0, "text": "a long rich history of using"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "symbols, literal, non-literal,"}, {"start": 49.0, "text": "as a method of communication,"}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "and we extend this to the modern"}, {"start": 53.0, "text": "world, but we apply the same"}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "principles to the user interface"}, {"start": 55.0, "text": "design."}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "For example, there was your"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "Macintosh."}, {"start": 59.0, "text": "We're going to take a quick trip"}, {"start": 60.0, "text": "down memory lane and take a"}, {"start": 62.0, "text": "closer look at some classic Mac"}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "OS icons."}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "Many metaphors have stuck around"}, {"start": 66.0, "text": "for three decades of Mac OS."}, {"start": 68.0, "text": "Investing in simple application"}, {"start": 70.0, "text": "iconography was a way to"}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "emotionally relate to the user."}, {"start": 73.0, "text": "It made the system approachable"}, {"start": 75.0, "text": "and easy to use."}, {"start": 77.0, "text": "It also made the platform unique"}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "and stand apart from the"}, {"start": 80.0, "text": "competition."}, {"start": 81.0, "text": "Many are close approximations of"}, {"start": 84.0, "text": "real world objects, and some"}, {"start": 86.0, "text": "concepts might be a little on"}, {"start": 87.0, "text": "the abstract side, but they all"}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "live within a system that tells"}, {"start": 90.0, "text": "a user that they're"}, {"start": 91.0, "text": "interconnected."}, {"start": 92.0, "text": "For example, they're"}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "appropriate; some are families,"}, {"start": 94.0, "text": "like families of maps or"}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "families of documents, and due"}, {"start": 99.0, "text": "to time, we've moved beyond some"}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "metaphors, either because the technology was surpassed, like"}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "the floppy disc; remember those,"}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "or the metaphor we're seeing is"}, {"start": 107.0, "text": "too aggressive, like the bomb."}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "Or we had to learn a concept"}, {"start": 112.0, "text": "like the hieroglyph ."}, {"start": 113.0, "text": "Over time the face was removed,"}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "and we've come to notice there's"}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "just the explanation point."}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "Even smaller glyphs share the"}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "same principle."}, {"start": 121.0, "text": "So, let's take a close look at"}, {"start": 122.0, "text": "one of my personal favorites,"}, {"start": 123.0, "text": "the paint bucket."}, {"start": 124.0, "text": "The paint bucket fills your"}, {"start": 126.0, "text": "canvas with color, just like"}, {"start": 128.0, "text": "spilling a real can of paint on"}, {"start": 129.0, "text": "the floor. At the time, this was an"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "abstract idea, but it was"}, {"start": 132.0, "text": "grounded here by a real world"}, {"start": 134.0, "text": "object. And how about how this was drawn"}, {"start": 137.0, "text": "even in those days?"}, {"start": 138.0, "text": "Consider the consistency of line"}, {"start": 140.0, "text": "weight."}, {"start": 141.0, "text": "There's implied movement in the"}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "angle, a subtle indication of"}, {"start": 145.0, "text": "perspective."}, {"start": 147.0, "text": "It's got a good balance of black"}, {"start": 148.0, "text": "and white. It's simple and high contrast."}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "These examples represent some"}, {"start": 152.0, "text": "fundamental principles that we"}, {"start": 154.0, "text": "still use today when designing"}, {"start": 155.0, "text": "app icons."}, {"start": 157.0, "text": "The first, metaphor, finding an"}, {"start": 159.0, "text": "easily identifiable metaphor"}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "that will object or graphic logo"}, {"start": 163.0, "text": "a mark."}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "The second, simplicity; your"}, {"start": 166.0, "text": "design should be simple and"}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "clear, no clutter or over"}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "complicate it."}, {"start": 170.0, "text": "If your icon is designed well,"}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "it should be quick and easy to"}, {"start": 173.0, "text": "read."}, {"start": 174.0, "text": "Connection."}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "Aiming to create an emotional"}, {"start": 176.0, "text": "connection with the user, the"}, {"start": 178.0, "text": "icon is the face of your app as"}, {"start": 179.0, "text": "much as the UI."}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "Keep it fun, keep it engaging."}, {"start": 182.0, "text": "And lineage, make changes to"}, {"start": 185.0, "text": "your icon meaningful and"}, {"start": 187.0, "text": "deliberate."}, {"start": 188.0, "text": "Don't change your app icon every"}, {"start": 189.0, "text": "single time that you update your"}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "app."}, {"start": 191.0, "text": "Refine your identity over time."}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "So, let's think about some of"}, {"start": 194.0, "text": "these principles as they related"}, {"start": 196.0, "text": "to an Apple app."}, {"start": 198.0, "text": "Keynote. Since version 1, all"}, {"start": 200.0, "text": "the way back in 2003, the app's"}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "identity has been the podium."}, {"start": 204.0, "text": "And why the podium, you ask?"}, {"start": 206.0, "text": "Well, the symbology is"}, {"start": 208.0, "text": "important, especially today of"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "all days."}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "It is a real old metaphor that"}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "many can relate to."}, {"start": 214.0, "text": "Presenters have used podiums for"}, {"start": 215.0, "text": "generations, and to add an"}, {"start": 217.0, "text": "emotional connection, the"}, {"start": 218.0, "text": "presenter notes rest on a warm"}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "wooden surface."}, {"start": 221.0, "text": "The microphone adds a familiar"}, {"start": 222.0, "text": "detail."}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "It immediately sets the stage"}, {"start": 224.0, "text": "for what keynote does, and we"}, {"start": 226.0, "text": "didn't want to lose that."}, {"start": 227.0, "text": "As keynote has moved from"}, {"start": 229.0, "text": "version to version, we updated"}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "the materials, and we've"}, {"start": 231.0, "text": "transitioned from a classic to a"}, {"start": 233.0, "text": "modern style, but the notion of"}, {"start": 235.0, "text": "the podium has remained"}, {"start": 236.0, "text": "consistent."}, {"start": 237.0, "text": "The lineage provides users with"}, {"start": 238.0, "text": "a sense of familiarity."}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "The podium was such a strong"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "mark that when we designed our"}, {"start": 242.0, "text": "apps for iOS, we simplified the"}, {"start": 244.0, "text": "podium to more of a glyph and"}, {"start": 246.0, "text": "brought it over."}, {"start": 247.0, "text": "The visual connection here is"}, {"start": 248.0, "text": "really important because it"}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "tells users that they can expect"}, {"start": 250.0, "text": "at consistent experience across"}, {"start": 252.0, "text": "platforms."}, {"start": 253.0, "text": "And if you have a family of"}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "apps, take a look at the iLook"}, {"start": 256.0, "text": "icons."}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "Keynote uses the podium on both"}, {"start": 259.0, "text": "Mac and iOS."}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "Pages uses the pen, a metaphor"}, {"start": 263.0, "text": "for writing and the written"}, {"start": 265.0, "text": "word."}, {"start": 266.0, "text": "The paper is denoted by a line"}, {"start": 267.0, "text": "on iOS but helps to ground the"}, {"start": 268.0, "text": "pen to a surface."}, {"start": 270.0, "text": "Numbers uses a flat and more 2D"}, {"start": 272.0, "text": "representation of the chart and"}, {"start": 274.0, "text": "the table on iOS."}, {"start": 276.0, "text": "We extend the same principles to"}, {"start": 278.0, "text": "GarageBand with, and iMovie with"}, {"start": 280.0, "text": "the guitar and the staff."}, {"start": 282.0, "text": "The metaphor in color palettes"}, {"start": 283.0, "text": "for all of these actually share"}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "the cross platform to reinforce"}, {"start": 286.0, "text": "the idea of family."}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "Let's focus in on a few details."}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "Some things are super important."}, {"start": 292.0, "text": "First off, the colors harmonize"}, {"start": 294.0, "text": "with the rest of iOSs vibrant"}, {"start": 295.0, "text": "color palette."}, {"start": 297.0, "text": "The glyphs are simple."}, {"start": 298.0, "text": "They all share the same mass."}, {"start": 300.0, "text": "They're white and high contrast."}, {"start": 301.0, "text": "There are no unnecessary"}, {"start": 303.0, "text": "details, and they all share the"}, {"start": 304.0, "text": "same ground plane."}, {"start": 306.0, "text": "This might just look like the"}, {"start": 308.0, "text": "Keynote podium, but there are"}, {"start": 309.0, "text": "some subtle optimizations"}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "within."}, {"start": 312.0, "text": "For example, the corners are all"}, {"start": 313.0, "text": "custom curves, so they appear"}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "really smooth, a large and small"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "size."}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "So, again, the same principles,"}, {"start": 319.0, "text": "metaphor, simplicity,"}, {"start": 320.0, "text": "connection, lineage."}, {"start": 322.0, "text": "Let's look at these as they"}, {"start": 323.0, "text": "relate to another app, music"}, {"start": 324.0, "text": "memo, shown here on the right."}, {"start": 326.0, "text": "There's a clear connection to"}, {"start": 327.0, "text": "the history of GarageBand"}, {"start": 329.0, "text": "through color and metaphor."}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "The circle is reminiscent of a"}, {"start": 331.0, "text": "sound hole in an acoustic"}, {"start": 333.0, "text": "guitar."}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "The strings vibrate in a playful"}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "graphic way."}, {"start": 336.0, "text": "There's a sense of movement and"}, {"start": 337.0, "text": "creativity."}, {"start": 339.0, "text": "The icon makes use of the iOS"}, {"start": 340.0, "text": "icon grid so that when music"}, {"start": 342.0, "text": "memos appears next to other"}, {"start": 343.0, "text": "icons in the system, the common"}, {"start": 345.0, "text": "elements like the circle are the"}, {"start": 347.0, "text": "same size as say Safari."}, {"start": 348.0, "text": "Now, we're going to do something"}, {"start": 350.0, "text": "a little fun."}, {"start": 351.0, "text": "We're going to take a look at"}, {"start": 352.0, "text": "the News app icon to look at"}, {"start": 354.0, "text": "some of the more practical"}, {"start": 355.0, "text": "considerations to think of when"}, {"start": 356.0, "text": "you design your app icon and"}, {"start": 357.0, "text": "some tests that you can do at"}, {"start": 359.0, "text": "home to make sure that your"}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "design is holding up at a"}, {"start": 361.0, "text": "smaller size."}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "So, let's ask ourselves a"}, {"start": 365.0, "text": "question, in a hypothetical"}, {"start": 367.0, "text": "world, what if News were the"}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "only app on the home screen?"}, {"start": 373.0, "text": "What would the icon have to"}, {"start": 374.0, "text": "communicate for it to be"}, {"start": 375.0, "text": "immediately clear that News does"}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "what News actually does?"}, {"start": 378.0, "text": "Or to be understood without a"}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "name underneath the icon?"}, {"start": 382.0, "text": "How would a good use of"}, {"start": 383.0, "text": "simplicity, form, color,"}, {"start": 385.0, "text": "contrast, composition help it to"}, {"start": 387.0, "text": "be understood?"}, {"start": 388.0, "text": "You think an icon would have to"}, {"start": 389.0, "text": "work twice as hard, right?"}, {"start": 391.0, "text": "Well, here's a few other props"}, {"start": 392.0, "text": "that we tried along the way."}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "The first icon here has a peak"}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "of paper is a little abstract."}, {"start": 398.0, "text": "Does the end rest on a"}, {"start": 399.0, "text": "newspaper, or a white box?"}, {"start": 400.0, "text": "A little hard to tell, and much"}, {"start": 401.0, "text": "of the red background is hidden."}, {"start": 403.0, "text": "The second introduces another"}, {"start": 405.0, "text": "sheet behind the first, which"}, {"start": 406.0, "text": "helps to reinforce the metaphor"}, {"start": 407.0, "text": "a little, but when the other"}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "edges are missing, you can't"}, {"start": 410.0, "text": "tell that the N is actually"}, {"start": 411.0, "text": "resting on a newspaper, and the"}, {"start": 412.0, "text": "color is still fairly hidden."}, {"start": 415.0, "text": "Let's look at the third design."}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "You can clearly see all the"}, {"start": 417.0, "text": "edges on the newspaper."}, {"start": 419.0, "text": "The white is high contrast; the"}, {"start": 420.0, "text": "red background pops."}, {"start": 422.0, "text": "The rendering of the newspaper"}, {"start": 423.0, "text": "and logo text is simple, bold,"}, {"start": 425.0, "text": "and graphic."}, {"start": 426.0, "text": "Why does this matter?"}, {"start": 428.0, "text": "Well, when you look at your icon"}, {"start": 429.0, "text": "on the Home screen, you can"}, {"start": 430.0, "text": "really see what holds up at a"}, {"start": 431.0, "text": "small size and is the right mix"}, {"start": 433.0, "text": "for contrast form and color."}, {"start": 435.0, "text": "Here's the three designs at a"}, {"start": 436.0, "text": "small size."}, {"start": 437.0, "text": "And try testing your icon in a"}, {"start": 439.0, "text": "folder next to other icons."}, {"start": 441.0, "text": "Squint your eyes."}, {"start": 443.0, "text": "Where's the news article?"}, {"start": 445.0, "text": "Right there on the top left."}, {"start": 446.0, "text": "And it's easy to see because of"}, {"start": 448.0, "text": "the simple design. The composition is distinct."}, {"start": 450.0, "text": "It's high contrast, and the"}, {"start": 451.0, "text": "color is clearly visible."}, {"start": 454.0, "text": "Designing an app icon is an"}, {"start": 456.0, "text": "iterative process."}, {"start": 457.0, "text": "So, here's some other things"}, {"start": 458.0, "text": "that you could think about as"}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "you start to design yours."}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "We'll start with the first,"}, {"start": 462.0, "text": "trying to be unique."}, {"start": 464.0, "text": "Now, that might sound like a"}, {"start": 465.0, "text": "tall order, but it's important"}, {"start": 467.0, "text": "to be really aware of other apps"}, {"start": 468.0, "text": "in your category."}, {"start": 469.0, "text": "Here's the three apps in the"}, {"start": 470.0, "text": "video space, Quick, Instagram,"}, {"start": 472.0, "text": "Periscope."}, {"start": 474.0, "text": "Let's look at how different"}, {"start": 475.0, "text": "these icons are."}, {"start": 476.0, "text": "Colors and shapes are bold."}, {"start": 478.0, "text": "Each is distinct; it stands out"}, {"start": 479.0, "text": "on the Home screen."}, {"start": 481.0, "text": "Instagram is also a great"}, {"start": 482.0, "text": "example of how an icon can"}, {"start": 483.0, "text": "become synonymous with a company"}, {"start": 485.0, "text": "the moment you see the white"}, {"start": 486.0, "text": "camera glyph, the purple sky,"}, {"start": 487.0, "text": "you immediately think Instagram."}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "Second, experiment."}, {"start": 494.0, "text": "Now, despite how beautiful a"}, {"start": 495.0, "text": "blank canvas is, starting here"}, {"start": 496.0, "text": "might be a little daunting."}, {"start": 498.0, "text": "So, why not try a little bit of"}, {"start": 500.0, "text": "sketching."}, {"start": 501.0, "text": "Even if you don't think you can"}, {"start": 502.0, "text": "raw, sometimes a pen and paper"}, {"start": 504.0, "text": "goes way further than a mouse,"}, {"start": 506.0, "text": "and sketching is a great way to"}, {"start": 507.0, "text": "get your ideas out without"}, {"start": 508.0, "text": "worrying about finessing your"}, {"start": 509.0, "text": "icon early on."}, {"start": 510.0, "text": "Do some doodles; show your"}, {"start": 512.0, "text": "friends; get their ideas."}, {"start": 513.0, "text": "This is your app icon, so your"}, {"start": 515.0, "text": "design has to pop."}, {"start": 516.0, "text": "Have some fun with it."}, {"start": 518.0, "text": "Further, and perhaps most"}, {"start": 520.0, "text": "important, test."}, {"start": 523.0, "text": "What do we mean by test?"}, {"start": 525.0, "text": "Well, as you develop your app"}, {"start": 526.0, "text": "icon, examine on the Home"}, {"start": 527.0, "text": "screen, in a folder, and if your"}, {"start": 529.0, "text": "app has settings, the settings"}, {"start": 530.0, "text": "app."}, {"start": 532.0, "text": "And be careful if you decide to"}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "represent your user interface in"}, {"start": 534.0, "text": "your icon."}, {"start": 535.0, "text": "Clear is a great example of"}, {"start": 537.0, "text": "doing this really, really well."}, {"start": 540.0, "text": "They've got a strong visual style with recognizable colors"}, {"start": 543.0, "text": "and a simple brand of pattern"}, {"start": 544.0, "text": "that really helps to stand out"}, {"start": 546.0, "text": "at a small size."}, {"start": 547.0, "text": "Again, it's simple, colorful,"}, {"start": 548.0, "text": "high contrast."}, {"start": 550.0, "text": "And last but not least, have"}, {"start": 552.0, "text": "some patience."}, {"start": 553.0, "text": "The answer might not come to you"}, {"start": 554.0, "text": "right away."}, {"start": 555.0, "text": "Take your time, examine your"}, {"start": 557.0, "text": "options, and save your work."}, {"start": 559.0, "text": "Oftentimes, it's the simplest"}, {"start": 561.0, "text": "design or an early direction"}, {"start": 562.0, "text": "that you abandoned that you"}, {"start": 563.0, "text": "actually ultimately find is the"}, {"start": 564.0, "text": "right choice."}, {"start": 566.0, "text": "So, to summarize, when designing"}, {"start": 569.0, "text": "your app icon, think about"}, {"start": 571.0, "text": "metaphor, a clearly identifiable"}, {"start": 574.0, "text": "object or symbol that is simple"}, {"start": 577.0, "text": "and easy to understand."}, {"start": 579.0, "text": "To create an emotional"}, {"start": 580.0, "text": "connection with the user, be"}, {"start": 581.0, "text": "fun, be playful."}, {"start": 583.0, "text": "And lineage, your icon is the"}, {"start": 585.0, "text": "face of your app."}, {"start": 586.0, "text": "It's our brand."}, {"start": 587.0, "text": "Think of your icon as an"}, {"start": 588.0, "text": "investment."}, {"start": 589.0, "text": "And for the process, try to make"}, {"start": 592.0, "text": "your icon unique so it stands"}, {"start": 593.0, "text": "out on the Home screen and the"}, {"start": 595.0, "text": "App Store."}, {"start": 596.0, "text": "Experiment with different"}, {"start": 597.0, "text": "designs and test them."}, {"start": 600.0, "text": "Use the icon grid."}, {"start": 601.0, "text": "Look at icons that Apple has"}, {"start": 602.0, "text": "designed as reference for form"}, {"start": 604.0, "text": "and color."}, {"start": 605.0, "text": "See what looks good, big and"}, {"start": 606.0, "text": "small."}, {"start": 607.0, "text": "Put your icon in a folder to see"}, {"start": 608.0, "text": "how it looks at a really small"}, {"start": 609.0, "text": "size."}, {"start": 610.0, "text": "And don't forget to optimize"}, {"start": 612.0, "text": "your assets for different device"}, {"start": 613.0, "text": "sizes."}, {"start": 614.0, "text": "And above all, have patience."}, {"start": 616.0, "text": "Designing an app icon can seem"}, {"start": 618.0, "text": "like a lot of work, but if you"}, {"start": 619.0, "text": "invest the time to do it, it can"}, {"start": 620.0, "text": "really, really pay off."}]}